  openingNarrative:
  - speaker: ""
    text: "Before memory, before motion, there was silence. Then, from the silence, Chronus opened his eyes, and Time began to flow."
  - speaker: ""
    text: "But where Time walked, a shadow followed: Thanatos, his brother. For every heartbeat Chronus granted, Thanatos took one away."
  - speaker: ""
    text: "Ages passed. Among the mortals rose a single man, his name lost to history, his legend carved into every age thereafter."
  - speaker: ""
    text: "His will caught the eye of Chronus, who blessed him with a spark of Time: the power to glimpse what would happen before it did."
  - speaker: ""
    text: "With it, he found a path through every enemy, and united the scattered lands beneath one ruler: himself."
  nextMap: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f6e3a18de684971ab07f84ba0b18cc3, type: 2}
